          {
            "title": "Question #1",
            "id": 120354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ketika permintaan HTTP gagal, apa satu hal yang selalu ingin kita lakukan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kirim pesan error kepada pengguna</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Atur kode status ke <code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kirim permintaan ke server lain</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kirim pesan error kepada pengguna.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ketika permintaan HTTP gagal, apa satu hal yang selalu ingin kita lakukan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kirim pesan error kepada pengguna</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Atur kode status ke <code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kirim permintaan ke server lain</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Mencoba ulang permintaan tanpa merespons pengguna</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kirim pesan error kepada pengguna.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example #2",
            "id": 120359,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi request <code>GET</code> untuk menyimpan informasi yang dikirim oleh klien.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"71\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>req.params</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question #4",
            "id": 120357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode apa yang kita gunakan dalam request <code>GET</code> ini untuk menetapkan kode status HTTP?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.status</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.json</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.params</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>res.status</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cabang untuk anggota yang tidak ditemukan merangkai <code>res.status(...).json(...)</code>. Apa yang dilakukan rangkaian tersebut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Menetapkan status error, lalu mengirim body error JSON</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mengirim JSON terlebih dahulu, lalu mengubah status setelah respons berakhir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Mengubah parameter rute sebelum mencoba ulang query</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Mengubah baris yang tidak ditemukan menjadi respons berhasil</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menetapkan status error, lalu mengirim body error JSON.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example #4",
            "id": 120361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi kode untuk menetapkan kode error <code>404</code> pada objek respons.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/books/:title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { title } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM books WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedBook = db.prepare(sql).get(title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedBook) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"book\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedBook\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"210\" endIndex=\"222\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>.status(404)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: SQL Database Connection",
            "id": 120848,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara menyiapkan pernyataan SQL yang disimpan dalam variabel <code>sql</code>, jika koneksi database kita disimpan dalam variabel <code>db</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>db.prepare(sql)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.execute(sql)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.query(sql)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>db.prepare(sql)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menetapkan <code>sql = \"SELECT * FROM flights\"</code>, lalu menulis <code>db.prepare(\"sql\")</code>.</p><p>Pengganti mana yang menyiapkan query yang kamu simpan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>db.prepare(sql)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.prepare(\"SELECT * FROM sql\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>sql.prepare(db)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>db.prepare(db)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>db.prepare(sql)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Response",
            "id": 120935,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Informasi apa yang harus disertakan endpoint <code>POST</code> dalam responsnya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kode status dan konfirmasi bahwa data telah ditambahkan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kode status dan hanya entri data baru</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hanya kode status</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kode status dan konfirmasi bahwa data telah ditambahkan.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu berhasil menambahkan penerbangan. Response mana yang menetapkan status yang sesuai dan menegaskan penambahan tersebut?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Status <code>201</code> dan <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Status <code>404</code> dan <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Status <code>201</code> dan hanya data penerbangan baru</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Status <code>201</code> dan <code>\"Flight deleted successfully\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Status <code>201</code> dan <code>\"Flight added successfully\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Endpoint Path",
            "id": 120849,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pilih endpoint yang benar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights = db.prepare(sql).all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"flights\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:number&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"/flights\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi endpoint koleksi yang mengembalikan semua penerbangan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM flights&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flights = db.prepare(sql).all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"flights\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": flights\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:id&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".get()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>get</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"/flights\"</code>, <code>\"SELECT * FROM flights\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>.all()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question #2",
            "id": 120355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan kode Express ketika pengguna meminta anggota yang tidak ada?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/members/:name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { name } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM members WHERE name = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedMember = db.prepare(sql).get(name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedMember) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested member&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"member\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedMember\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mengirimkan pesan error kepada klien</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Terjadi error dan client tidak menerima informasi apa pun</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Server meminta informasi tambahan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mengirimkan pesan error kepada klien.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pencarian database mungkin tidak menemukan anggota. Mengapa handler memeriksa hasilnya sebelum mengirim JSON keberhasilan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/members/:name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { name } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM members WHERE name = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestedMember = db.prepare(sql).get(name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!requestedMember) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't find requested member&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"member\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": requestedMember\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Untuk mengembalikan error anggota tidak ditemukan, bukan respons keberhasilan palsu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Untuk menjalankan ulang pencarian yang sama sampai anggota muncul</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Untuk mengganti id yang diminta dengan id anggota pertama</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Untuk otomatis menyisipkan anggota baru ketika tidak ada yang ditemukan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Untuk mengembalikan error anggota tidak ditemukan, bukan respons keberhasilan palsu.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: SQL & PUT & DELETE",
            "id": 120994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis pernyataan SQL apa yang terkait dengan endpoint PUT?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">PERBARUI</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">DELETE</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">DROP</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih PERBARUI.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Handler <code>PUT /flights/:id</code> mengganti field penerbangan yang ditentukan. Bentuk SQL mana yang sesuai dengan operasi tersebut?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>UPDATE flights ... WHERE id = ?</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE FROM flights WHERE id = ?</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP TABLE flights</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>INSERT INTO flights ...</code> tanpa kondisi id</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>UPDATE flights ... WHERE id = ?</code></p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: DELETE II",
            "id": 120998,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi sintaks <code>response</code> untuk endpoint <code>DELETE</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.delete(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/flights/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { id } = req.params;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sql = \" /><text value=\"&quot;DELETE FROM flights WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = db.prepare(sql).run(id);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (result.changes &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"     \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Flight deleted successfully&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"     \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Flight not found&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"197\" endIndex=\"200\" /><option startIndex=\"200\" endIndex=\"201\" /><option startIndex=\"201\" endIndex=\"207\" /><option startIndex=\"207\" endIndex=\"208\" /><option startIndex=\"208\" endIndex=\"211\" /><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"201\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>res</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>status</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>200</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
